# FlashyCardy - Next.js Project Structure

This is a Next.js 15 application using the App Router with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS.

## Project Structure

```
flashycardy/
├── src/
│   └── app/                    # App Router directory
│       ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout component
│       ├── page.tsx            # Home page component
│       ├── globals.css         # Global styles with Tailwind
│       └── favicon.ico         # App favicon
├── public/                     # Static assets
├── package.json               # Dependencies and scripts
├── next.config.ts             # Next.js configuration
├── tsconfig.json              # TypeScript configuration
├── postcss.config.mjs         # PostCSS configuration for Tailwind
└── eslint.config.mjs          # ESLint configuration
```

## Key Files

- **[layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/layout.tsx)** - Root layout with font configuration and metadata
- **[page.tsx](mdc:src/app/page.tsx)** - Main home page component
- **[globals.css](mdc:src/app/globals.css)** - Global styles with CSS variables and Tailwind import
- **[package.json](mdc:package.json)** - Project dependencies including Next.js 16.1.1, React 19, and Tailwind CSS v4

## Development Guidelines

1. **App Router**: Use the `src/app/` directory for all routes and layouts
2. **TypeScript**: All components should be TypeScript with proper type definitions
3. **Styling**: Use Tailwind CSS classes for styling, CSS variables for theming
4. **Components**: Create reusable components in `src/components/` (to be created)
5. **Fonts**: Project uses Geist Sans and Geist Mono fonts from Google Fonts
6. **Dark Mode**: Support for system preference dark mode via CSS variables

## Recommended Directory Structure for Flashcard App

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── (dashboard)/           # Route groups for dashboard
│   ├── flashcards/           # Flashcard-related pages
│   ├── study/                # Study session pages
│   └── settings/             # Settings pages
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                   # shadcn/ui components
│   ├── flashcard/           # Flashcard-specific components
│   └── common/              # Shared components
├── lib/                     # Utility functions and configurations
├── hooks/                   # Custom React hooks
└── types/                   # TypeScript type definitions
```